## Interface: 120100, 16001
## Title: SMoRG's QoL
## Notes: Hear your quest progress: a worker voice line when you complete a quest objective, and another when the whole quest is done (Horde Peon or Alliance worker). Plus toggleable quality-of-life tweaks: colored quest progress, quest auto-tracking, a range icon and distance, tooltip targets, item level and movement speed, XP/reputation colors, party levels, reputation watching, cursor highlight, and ready check/queue countdowns. Options window via LDB, the addon compartment or /sqol config.
